 enjoy the book  until next time mate i appreciate you  thanks chris appreciate it what's  happening people thank you very much for  tuning in if you enjoyed that episode  then press here for a selection of the  best clips from the podcast over the  last few weeks and don't forget to  subscribe  peace  you
 

